                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The vaulted monumental structure at the western end of a church constructed in some medieval styles, flanked by two towers and containing the entrance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b10ca601-a32e-470d-a72a-005d41ba671b",
                                                "sense_id": "774ace91-9d53-30e3-84e0-d148f024c0f3",
                                                "text": "Facing the raised sanctuary over the vast crypt they also often erected at the west end of the nave a towerlike structure with vaulted stories, that we call the \"westwork.\""
